WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:52.552 --> 01:54.056
(Bye, Wild Weasel)

01:54.056 --> 01:57.257
(A polished-to-a-shine Maybach is parked
under the office.)

01:57.856 --> 02:00.817
(A suited man pushes the car door open.)

02:01.296 --> 02:05.416
(An exceptionally handsome
and tall man came into view.)

02:06.416 --> 02:07.617
(He raises an eyebrow.)

02:07.776 --> 02:09.217
(He's wearing gold-rimmed glasses.)

02:09.616 --> 02:11.696
(His sharp gaze is hidden
behind the lenses.)

02:12.176 --> 02:13.057
(He glances down.)

02:13.456 --> 02:14.416
(A high bridge nose.)

02:57.096 --> 03:00.040
=Episode 1=

03:00.696 --> 03:03.377
After your acquisition of our company,

03:03.896 --> 03:06.537
your group's resources
will be bolstered.

03:07.136 --> 03:10.097
Currently,
about one-third of the streamers,

03:10.377 --> 03:12.217
I mean the top streamers,

03:12.817 --> 03:13.777
work for my company.

03:14.337 --> 03:14.896
Mr. Gao.

03:15.337 --> 03:16.616
Two of our female streamers

03:17.856 --> 03:21.236
are doing a live PK battle
about the novel "Bye, Wild Weasel".

03:21.236 --> 03:22.136
Want to take a look?

03:22.136 --> 03:22.636
Sure.

03:24.817 --> 03:26.977
(The female lead
in the book "Bye, Wild Weasel",)

03:26.977 --> 03:28.537
(was far too dependent on love.)

03:28.817 --> 03:29.977
(Personally, I believe)

03:30.456 --> 03:33.016
love isn't a necessity in life.

03:33.497 --> 03:35.817
It's merely a little dessert
after the main course.

03:36.537 --> 03:37.736
(Huan'er made a good point.)

03:38.377 --> 03:41.777
(But I heard
you haven't had much dating experience.)

03:42.416 --> 03:44.937
- (In that case,)
- Ai Qing isn't following the script.

03:44.937 --> 03:46.337
(how do you understand love?)

03:47.337 --> 03:49.777
(What kind of person
do you consider a true love expert?)

03:50.416 --> 03:52.696
(Is it someone
who's in only one relationship)

03:52.977 --> 03:55.977
(or someone who's constantly falling in
and out of love?)

03:56.537 --> 03:59.537
(That's exactly why I'm here
to share my experience.)

03:59.817 --> 04:00.977
(Create a romantic moment.)

04:01.377 --> 04:04.777
(Or use certain props
to achieve your goal,)

04:05.176 --> 04:07.537
(fluffy pets, for instance.)

04:07.576 --> 04:09.257
(Your ideas are so cliché.)

04:10.097 --> 04:13.696
(The values from the old-school dramas
don't fit modern society anymore.)

04:14.537 --> 04:15.856
That's where you're mistaken.

04:16.296 --> 04:19.616
Touch, hugs, and kisses,

04:20.097 --> 04:23.856
these all build trust and intimacy.

04:23.856 --> 04:26.337
(Ai Qing,
how exactly do you understand love?)

04:26.777 --> 04:28.777
(The female lead in this book,)

04:29.137 --> 04:30.936
(if not for the author's intervention,)

04:30.936 --> 04:32.416
could've been cheated many times.

04:32.657 --> 04:34.777
(What exactly did she do
to win a man's heart?)

04:35.097 --> 04:37.496
Moreover, I'd like to ask
about the men in this book.

04:37.856 --> 04:39.577
(Which one is truly worth loving?)

04:40.457 --> 04:41.217
Not worth it?

04:41.697 --> 04:43.256
(Sweetie, a word of advice...)

04:45.936 --> 04:46.697
What's wrong?

04:47.137 --> 04:49.217
Huan'er, Mr. Zeng ordered it shut down.

04:50.537 --> 04:51.296
This is Ai Qing.

04:51.496 --> 04:54.337
This streamer is hugely popular
with audiences right now.

04:54.977 --> 04:56.856
I gave her that name.

04:57.577 --> 04:59.457
It perfectly matches her appearance.

04:59.496 --> 05:00.537
My company is building...

05:00.537 --> 05:01.856
Why did you cut my stream?

05:04.097 --> 05:04.897
Who let you in?

05:05.376 --> 05:06.416
I'm meeting a guest.

05:06.777 --> 05:07.537
Don't barge in.

05:07.537 --> 05:09.777
I didn't make any mistakes on stream.

05:10.217 --> 05:12.017
A book reflects its era.

05:12.217 --> 05:13.657
Take the book "Bye, Wild Weasel",

05:13.856 --> 05:16.296
its values are outdated
by today's standards.

05:16.457 --> 05:18.296
Its values shouldn't be endorsed.

05:18.457 --> 05:21.496
A girl pitifully sacrificing everything
for a man

05:21.496 --> 05:23.056
just to win a man's love.

05:23.217 --> 05:24.176
That's wrong.

05:24.416 --> 05:25.496
It's not a good thing.

05:25.496 --> 05:26.657
If she's lucky,

05:26.657 --> 05:27.657
she might be happy.

05:27.657 --> 05:29.017
What if she's not?

05:29.017 --> 05:30.056
Her life could be ruined.

05:30.897 --> 05:31.616
Could you leave?

05:32.137 --> 05:32.777
Talk later.

05:32.777 --> 05:33.936
That's all I have to say.

05:33.936 --> 05:34.816
Restore my stream.

05:34.816 --> 05:35.616
Or I quit.

05:37.256 --> 05:37.736
Lin Huan'er.

05:55.616 --> 05:59.697
Could you host another stream
on the book, Bye, Wild Weasel?

06:02.137 --> 06:02.936
I'll be watching.

06:08.416 --> 06:10.296
And you are?

06:10.856 --> 06:15.457
This is the potential buyer
of our company.

06:16.416 --> 06:19.496
Do you really think none of the men
in this book are worth loving?

06:23.777 --> 06:25.056
Well...

06:28.537 --> 06:30.537
Once Mr. Zeng restores my stream,

06:31.337 --> 06:33.056
you'll hear my answer tonight.

06:47.176 --> 06:47.736
Restore.

06:55.416 --> 06:57.017
(Do you know what this is?)

06:57.137 --> 07:00.577
This is a pager,
hugely popular before the millennium.

07:01.176 --> 07:02.337
Do you know its function?

07:02.792 --> 07:04.056
If someone wanted to reach you,

07:04.337 --> 07:06.376
they'd send a message
to the paging service.

07:07.577 --> 07:09.176
Your pager would receive it.

07:09.217 --> 07:10.897
Then you'd have to find a phone

07:10.897 --> 07:12.137
and call them back.

07:12.416 --> 07:13.496
Inconvenient, right?

07:14.217 --> 07:17.736
Frankly, it was just a tool
dependent on telephones.

07:18.457 --> 07:20.416
It lacked its own vitality.

07:20.416 --> 07:22.097
No surprise it's obsolete now.

07:22.777 --> 07:24.296
Sweetie, a word of advice,

07:24.856 --> 07:26.577
we're the service providers at work.

07:26.577 --> 07:28.970
Don't play that role
in relationships too.

07:28.970 --> 07:31.616
(It'd be quite something if you were
the female lead of the novel.)

07:31.616 --> 07:33.176
I could never be the female lead.

07:33.256 --> 07:35.577
The only thing
I share with her is the name.

07:36.017 --> 07:38.097
Otherwise, we're nothing alike.

07:39.176 --> 07:40.256
Now, let's talk about this.

07:41.457 --> 07:44.376
This is the hero's favorite toy
in the book.

07:45.697 --> 07:47.777
It's a model
of the weasel-shaped warcraft.

07:48.777 --> 07:50.337
It looks exquisite.

07:50.856 --> 07:53.296
But here's its fatal flaw.

07:53.816 --> 07:55.137
You have to assemble it yourself.

07:55.296 --> 07:56.697
It's incredibly fragile.

07:57.217 --> 07:58.856
The slightest bump could shatter it.

07:59.376 --> 08:00.816
Sounds like love, right?

09:21.697 --> 09:23.057
Isn't the museum closed today?

09:23.417 --> 09:24.337
Who are you?

09:24.496 --> 09:25.656
Why are you here?

09:35.856 --> 09:36.697
It's you!

09:39.376 --> 09:40.656
Who exactly are you?

09:41.776 --> 09:42.817
How did I get here?

09:45.697 --> 09:47.457
Why is my head so fuzzy?

09:47.856 --> 09:49.057
Did you bring me here?

09:49.817 --> 09:50.817
It's 1999 already.

09:51.097 --> 09:52.496
I suggest you watch your words.

09:53.097 --> 09:53.856
Please leave.

09:56.896 --> 09:58.896
1999? What do you mean?

10:02.136 --> 10:02.656
Stop!

10:03.496 --> 10:04.057
Miss.

10:04.457 --> 10:05.417
You broke something.

10:05.896 --> 10:06.977
You think you can leave?

10:07.536 --> 10:08.656
Another one?

10:08.656 --> 10:09.536
Who are you?

10:09.896 --> 10:10.937
I'll pay!

10:11.297 --> 10:12.376
Huan'er, are you alright?

10:13.016 --> 10:14.057
Who are you?

10:14.656 --> 10:15.697
What's wrong?

10:16.536 --> 10:17.337
This isn't right.

10:18.177 --> 10:19.656
Shouldn't I be live-streaming now?

10:20.616 --> 10:21.536
Where on earth am I?

10:21.536 --> 10:21.896
Stop!

10:21.896 --> 10:23.057
- Pay up!
- I will!

10:23.417 --> 10:24.297
Leave her alone.

10:24.616 --> 10:25.177
How much?

10:25.736 --> 10:26.896
Get me out of here!

10:28.016 --> 10:30.656
Welcome to the world
of the book "Bye, Wild Weasel".

10:31.496 --> 10:32.872
(Welcome to the world
of the book "Bye, Wild Weasel")

10:36.616 --> 10:37.656
I'm hallucinating.

10:39.097 --> 10:40.417
Must be low blood sugar.

10:41.736 --> 10:42.217
Well...

10:48.097 --> 10:50.937
Isn't this the pager prop
I use for my streams?

10:50.937 --> 10:52.016
How did it get here?

10:53.776 --> 10:55.376
As the female lead of this game,

10:55.496 --> 10:56.736
please follow the rules

10:56.817 --> 10:58.057
to complete your quests.

10:59.177 --> 11:00.057
I'm sorry?

11:01.256 --> 11:02.896
Are you telling me

11:03.337 --> 11:06.177
that I'm inside the old romance novel?

11:06.817 --> 11:08.536
Yes. The rules are as follows.

11:09.177 --> 11:12.977
First, do not reveal, in any form,
to non-player characters in the story.

11:12.977 --> 11:16.008
Second, don't change the relationship
between the male lead and female lead.

11:16.008 --> 11:18.856
Third, do not let anyone
in the book know your true identity.

11:19.136 --> 11:21.177
Otherwise,
the penalty system will activate.

11:21.256 --> 11:22.417
This is insane!

11:23.496 --> 11:25.057
To help you integrate into the story,

11:25.177 --> 11:27.016
the system will issue a Newbie Pack.

11:27.057 --> 11:27.896
Please check for it.

11:28.297 --> 11:31.016
Come on! Forget the pack!

11:31.016 --> 11:33.496
Just get me out of here! Got it?

11:33.496 --> 11:34.217
Out!

11:34.817 --> 11:35.417
No, wait...

11:37.697 --> 11:38.736
This has to be a dream.

11:43.097 --> 11:43.697
Right here.

11:56.736 --> 11:58.177
Sir, is everything okay?

11:58.297 --> 11:59.177
What's the noise?

11:59.457 --> 12:00.977
Nothing. I just ran into a freak.

12:06.656 --> 12:07.417
Huan'er?

12:07.817 --> 12:08.817
What's wrong?

12:09.016 --> 12:10.297
Do you need a hospital?

12:15.616 --> 12:16.297
I get it.

12:17.177 --> 12:19.057
You know what's going on, don't you?

12:19.057 --> 12:20.376
Can you explain this to me?

12:20.856 --> 12:22.057
What's wrong?

12:22.057 --> 12:23.177
Are you alright?

12:23.177 --> 12:24.536
Is that the only line you know?

12:24.536 --> 12:25.616
Can you say something else?

12:25.856 --> 12:27.736
What's wrong, Huan'er?

12:27.736 --> 12:28.697
Okay, tell me.

12:28.697 --> 12:29.697
What's your name?

12:31.256 --> 12:33.337
What's wrong?

12:35.577 --> 12:37.896
Name! Just the name!

12:38.656 --> 12:41.297
For example,
I'm Lin Huan'er. Who are you?

12:42.896 --> 12:44.016
I'm Mengmeng.

12:44.016 --> 12:44.977
Zhu Mengmeng.

12:45.136 --> 12:46.376
- Zhu Mengmeng?
- What's wrong?

12:46.376 --> 12:47.937
- Mengmeng?
- You don't remember me?

12:47.937 --> 12:48.776
Vaguely.

12:50.136 --> 12:52.736
You're Lin Huan'er's childhood friend
in the book,

12:52.736 --> 12:54.616
a rich, beautiful cartoonist, right?

12:55.616 --> 12:57.177
Oh, thank goodness! You remember me!

12:58.217 --> 13:00.656
Anyway, whether this is some prank game,

13:00.656 --> 13:02.697
a live-action show, VR, or whatever,

13:03.097 --> 13:05.656
our top priority is finding clues
and getting out, right?

13:05.656 --> 13:07.337
Otherwise, NPCs can't get off work.

13:07.616 --> 13:09.376
Come on. Assign the quest.

13:09.937 --> 13:11.097
What's wrong?

13:11.856 --> 13:12.697
Huan'er?

13:13.457 --> 13:15.937
Your assignment method
is seriously old-school.

13:16.536 --> 13:18.656
Congratulations!
You've received the Newbie Pack.

13:21.417 --> 13:23.217
Now, please complete your first quest.

13:23.616 --> 13:25.616
Wire 10,000 to Ou Xiaojue.

13:26.736 --> 13:27.577
Who is Ou Xiaojue?

13:28.656 --> 13:29.536
Who is Ou Xiaojue?

13:30.417 --> 13:31.417
Huan'er, what's wrong?

13:31.417 --> 13:32.616
Why is your memory fragmented?

13:32.616 --> 13:33.817
Why are you saying that again?

13:33.817 --> 13:34.656
Never mind.

13:35.057 --> 13:35.817
Just be quiet.

13:35.817 --> 13:37.297
Let me sort this out.

13:37.776 --> 13:39.177
Ou Xiaojue is...

13:39.177 --> 13:40.057
Ou...

13:42.536 --> 13:46.817
Is Ou Xiaojue the bad boyfriend
of Lin Huan'er in the book?

13:46.817 --> 13:48.297
The guy who cheated on her?

13:48.577 --> 13:49.856
Seems my memory's good.

13:50.496 --> 13:53.297
But why must
Lin Huan'er love Ou Xiaojue?

13:53.297 --> 13:55.057
In the book, there is a good man.

13:55.057 --> 13:57.337
I mean the cool guy, Gao...

13:58.016 --> 13:59.577
Player, please follow the rules.

13:59.616 --> 14:01.256
Do not alter their relationships.

14:01.496 --> 14:02.256
No spoilers.

14:02.417 --> 14:04.097
Violators will trigger
the penalty system,

14:04.097 --> 14:05.097
initiating Time Rewind.

14:05.256 --> 14:06.417
You only have five chances.

14:06.457 --> 14:07.536
If all are run out,

14:07.616 --> 14:09.097
you'll face awful consequences.

14:09.417 --> 14:11.736
Which genius invented these game rules?

14:12.177 --> 14:13.856
What's the worst that could happen?

14:15.016 --> 14:17.672
Lin Huan'er would break up
with Ou Xiaojue and see someone else.

14:18.496 --> 14:19.817
Now, only four chances remain.

14:20.177 --> 14:21.217
You will be punished.

14:21.457 --> 14:22.697
Time Rewind.

14:27.656 --> 14:28.697
(Awful system!)

14:28.697 --> 14:29.776
(It happened again.)

14:29.776 --> 14:31.256
Huan'er, what's wrong?

14:31.736 --> 14:33.057
Do you need a hospital?

14:33.817 --> 14:34.656
I'm fine.

14:34.656 --> 14:35.464
I'm okay.

14:35.464 --> 14:36.297
You're Zhu Mengmeng.

14:36.297 --> 14:36.977
I'm Lin Huan'er.

14:36.977 --> 14:38.217
We are best friends.

14:38.217 --> 14:39.297
Don't talk right now.

14:39.297 --> 14:40.337
Don't ask me if I'm okay.

14:43.097 --> 14:45.417
You crappy game system!

14:45.697 --> 14:46.896
Do you even have any ethics?

14:47.177 --> 14:50.417
You gave me a main quest
to make a powerful man love me,

14:50.417 --> 14:52.616
but then you forbid me
from changing any relationships?

14:52.616 --> 14:53.776
Are you insane?

14:54.256 --> 14:55.616
Do not insult the system.

14:55.817 --> 14:56.776
Time Rewind.

14:59.937 --> 15:01.337
(Got set up by the system.)

15:02.376 --> 15:04.136
Huan'er, what's wrong?

15:05.817 --> 15:06.856
Zhu Mengmeng, right?

15:07.136 --> 15:08.097
Just wait a second.

15:08.297 --> 15:09.776
I'm going to fight a lousy system!

15:19.217 --> 15:20.016
Huan'er?

15:21.457 --> 15:22.417
What's wrong?

15:28.776 --> 15:29.817
Can I break up with him?

15:31.297 --> 15:32.817
It requires the man to initiate it.

15:34.937 --> 15:37.417
Fine! I'll play along with you.

15:37.697 --> 15:38.977
Wire the money? I'll wire it.

15:39.297 --> 15:41.016
But isn't 10,000 a bit too much?

15:41.016 --> 15:42.217
Even if it's just in a game,

15:42.217 --> 15:44.177
I don't want that bad guy
to take advantage of me.

15:44.417 --> 15:45.457
According to the system,

15:45.496 --> 15:47.536
you must wire 10,000 to Ou Xiaojue.

15:47.656 --> 15:48.736
If you don't...

15:48.736 --> 15:49.616
Enough!

15:49.616 --> 15:50.697
Stop nagging!

15:50.697 --> 15:51.417
I'll wire it.

15:51.457 --> 15:52.736
10,000, right? Fine.

15:57.136 --> 15:57.856
Huan'er,

15:58.457 --> 15:59.817
shall we go to the hospital?

16:00.136 --> 16:02.097
You've been talking to yourself here.

16:02.376 --> 16:03.736
Come on, Zhu Mengmeng!

16:03.736 --> 16:05.536
We should be going
to the bank right now.

16:05.937 --> 16:06.856
Take me there. Hurry!

16:07.177 --> 16:09.136
Quick! Where's the bank? Let's go!

16:09.656 --> 16:10.256
Which way?

16:14.937 --> 16:18.097
Letao has been the exclusive agent
for your domestic sales for five years.

16:18.097 --> 16:21.097
It's fair to say
we've popularized your company's brands.

16:21.337 --> 16:23.177
Renewal terms are negotiable,

16:23.376 --> 16:25.057
but demanding 20% right off the bat?

16:26.256 --> 16:27.536
If this is your attitude,

16:27.817 --> 16:29.616
we won't need
to continue this discussion.

16:29.977 --> 16:30.536
Sorry.

16:34.856 --> 16:35.496
Mr. Gao.

16:35.937 --> 16:37.057
Heading back to the company?

16:39.057 --> 16:43.896
Oh, the Chairman said you must join
the board meeting tomorrow at 9 AM.

16:46.577 --> 16:47.896
The senior board members will go.

16:47.896 --> 16:49.417
Just go and show your face.

16:52.016 --> 16:55.177
New brands will enter the mall
tomorrow morning.

16:55.177 --> 16:56.136
Letao is among them.

16:56.337 --> 16:57.217
I need to go.

16:57.697 --> 16:58.496
I've checked this.

16:58.817 --> 17:00.136
I can adjust your schedule.

17:01.856 --> 17:02.536
Got it.

17:19.336 --> 17:20.736
What are you looking at? Let's go!

17:38.137 --> 17:40.217
This place is awesome.

17:41.096 --> 17:41.617
Mengmeng.

17:42.177 --> 17:44.736
You're literally my deluxe Newbie Pack.

17:46.457 --> 17:47.816
Huan'er, what's wrong?

17:47.977 --> 17:49.736
I can't understand anything
you're saying.

17:49.857 --> 17:50.736
Are you okay?

17:52.177 --> 17:53.217
It's okay, Mengmeng.

17:53.576 --> 17:55.816
You'll get used to it gradually.

17:56.816 --> 17:58.457
I'll get you something to drink.

17:59.377 --> 17:59.857
Thank you.

18:07.464 --> 18:10.728
(Certificates)

18:18.576 --> 18:19.937
(Huan'er, I got the money.)

18:20.256 --> 18:21.857
(Why is it only 10,000 Vietnamese dong?)

18:22.056 --> 18:23.536
(That's only three yuan in RMB.)

18:23.897 --> 18:25.096
(Did you make a mistake?)

18:26.816 --> 18:28.977
Congratulations
on completing your quest.

18:28.977 --> 18:30.697
You've wired 10,000 to Ou Xiaojue.

18:31.657 --> 18:32.377
It worked.

18:32.536 --> 18:34.377
Now, I'm issuing the main quest.

18:34.576 --> 18:35.417
As the female lead,

18:35.457 --> 18:38.496
your ultimate quest is
to date the male lead, Gao Haiming.

18:38.736 --> 18:41.496
Only by getting his proposal
can you return to your original world.

18:41.897 --> 18:45.096
The male lead's fondness
towards you will be tracked as a KPI.

18:45.137 --> 18:45.816
Go for it!

18:46.457 --> 18:47.016
Besides,

18:47.016 --> 18:49.137
- So troublesome.
- you'll inhabit this world

18:49.137 --> 18:52.096
as Lin Huan'er, live your daily life,
and trigger side quests.

18:52.096 --> 18:55.336
Completion of side quests directly
impacts the reward and penalty

18:55.417 --> 18:57.096
and unlocks hidden quests.

18:57.377 --> 18:58.336
Someone's paging you.

18:59.016 --> 18:59.897
It's work-related?

19:01.897 --> 19:02.377
Here.

19:05.800 --> 19:08.377
(Attendees: Letao Group, Yunxiang Company,
Huayang Company, Ouzheng Company)

19:08.377 --> 19:09.217
(Letao?)

19:10.056 --> 19:11.457
(Sounds so familiar.)

19:12.496 --> 19:16.256
(Isn't the male lead, Gao Haiming,
in the novel Letao's general manager?)

19:17.064 --> 19:17.800
(It's my chance.)

19:19.417 --> 19:19.937
Mengmeng.

19:21.617 --> 19:24.217
Let's go to this event together.

19:26.408 --> 19:28.424
(A Feast of Trends;
A Rendezvous with Fashion)

19:28.424 --> 19:30.344
(Letao: Motherly Tenderness)

19:30.344 --> 19:31.848
(Grand Opening)

19:34.736 --> 19:35.816
Come check it out.

19:35.816 --> 19:37.296
Hello, our department store is open.

19:37.296 --> 19:38.056
Come on in.

19:38.056 --> 19:39.336
(Welcome Key Enterprises to the Mall)

19:40.040 --> 19:42.312
(A Feast of Trends;
A Rendezvous with Fashion)

19:45.096 --> 19:46.217
So many people!

19:47.137 --> 19:49.256
So this is the fanciest mall here?

19:49.617 --> 19:50.177
Yeah.

19:59.177 --> 20:00.697
My friend's calling me. Look around.

20:05.736 --> 20:07.944
(Unite to Move Forward; Win the Future)

20:15.736 --> 20:19.096
Let's give a round of applause
to welcome the chairmen

20:19.417 --> 20:20.417
of Huayang Company,

20:20.977 --> 20:22.177
Ouzheng Company,

20:22.457 --> 20:23.496
Letao Group,

20:24.177 --> 20:26.377
and Yunxiang Company

20:27.336 --> 20:29.736
to cut the ribbon for the mall!

20:29.857 --> 20:31.496
- Great!
- Great!

20:31.536 --> 20:32.816
So handsome!

20:33.576 --> 20:34.897
So handsome!

20:34.897 --> 20:36.816
Mr. Gao is
as handsome as the rumors say.

20:36.816 --> 20:38.137
This trip was worth it.

20:38.736 --> 20:39.897
This trip was worth it.

20:39.897 --> 20:41.056
Yeah.

20:43.417 --> 20:45.457
May it bring thriving business!

20:46.736 --> 20:49.056
May it usher in abundant wealth!

20:49.736 --> 20:53.377
May it bring a beautiful
and happy life to all citizens!

20:57.736 --> 20:58.897
So handsome.

20:58.897 --> 20:59.617
What a hot guy.

20:59.617 --> 21:00.617
Which one is Mr. Gao?

21:00.816 --> 21:02.417
That one! That's Mr. Gao.

21:02.536 --> 21:03.296
The one in a suit?

21:03.296 --> 21:04.296
Yes! That's him.

21:05.536 --> 21:06.536
Yes, he is quite hot.

21:15.457 --> 21:16.496
(Gao Haiming)

21:17.016 --> 21:18.296
(is an imposing figure)

21:18.296 --> 21:19.377
(with bright eyes.)

21:19.977 --> 21:22.496
(He is also a neat guy
with slightly wavy, soft hair,)

21:22.496 --> 21:25.016
(and a faint smile on his lips.)

21:27.576 --> 21:28.496
(Yes.)

21:28.977 --> 21:29.897
(No doubt.)

21:29.937 --> 21:30.736
(It's him.)

21:31.576 --> 21:33.256
(Just as described in the book,)

21:33.657 --> 21:36.096
(he is a successful man in the 1990s.)

21:45.576 --> 21:47.176
(Welcome Cocktail Party)

22:04.977 --> 22:07.457
(So this is the fancy party in 1999?)

22:10.056 --> 22:10.937
(Just so-so.)

22:16.016 --> 22:16.617
Mr. Gao.

22:17.056 --> 22:17.937
Since you're here,

22:18.736 --> 22:19.816
why not mingle more?

22:22.177 --> 22:24.857
I'm here to know about market trends.

22:25.137 --> 22:26.697
Chatting is a waste of time.

22:28.937 --> 22:30.096
Look who's here.

22:31.377 --> 22:32.417
Mr. Gao.

22:33.296 --> 22:35.096
We don't often see you at gatherings.

22:35.496 --> 22:39.336
Indeed, Mr. Gao,
you're quite an impressive young man.

22:40.536 --> 22:41.977
You should socialize more.

22:42.336 --> 22:43.857
Yes, you are both seniors.

22:43.857 --> 22:44.617
Can be my teacher.

22:45.457 --> 22:47.217
I'm not qualified to teach you.

22:47.736 --> 22:49.096
You're doing better than us.

22:51.336 --> 22:54.857
It seems Mr. Gao has real expertise
in women's goods.

22:55.336 --> 22:59.256
That's why the industry
calls him the Sanitary Pad King.

23:00.016 --> 23:00.897
I'm flattered.

23:01.177 --> 23:02.336
- Sure.
- Look.

23:02.336 --> 23:03.697
Mr. Gao is so progressive.

23:04.177 --> 23:07.336
He doesn't care about that title at all.

23:07.816 --> 23:09.096
If we were him,

23:09.217 --> 23:10.857
we would feel embarrassed.

23:12.536 --> 23:13.897
The millennium is almost here.

23:14.217 --> 23:16.056
Young people should be progressive,

23:16.177 --> 23:17.336
or we'll be left behind.

23:18.296 --> 23:20.536
I have something else to do.
I have to go.

23:25.697 --> 23:27.056
Sorry about this.

23:27.056 --> 23:27.776
No problem.

23:28.576 --> 23:29.016
Alright.

23:47.857 --> 23:48.977
Huan'er, where did you go?

23:48.977 --> 23:49.937
I finally found you.

23:52.617 --> 23:53.256
What's going on?

23:53.897 --> 23:55.096
I'm looking for my ending.

23:55.377 --> 23:56.096
The finale.

23:57.296 --> 23:58.296
The finale?

24:02.256 --> 24:02.937
Mengmeng,

24:04.016 --> 24:05.897
I'm so glad
we got to be friends for a day.

24:06.217 --> 24:07.736
But now it's time to say goodbye.

24:08.857 --> 24:09.576
Goodbye?

24:10.776 --> 24:11.816
What's wrong?

24:12.016 --> 24:12.937
You're acting strange.

24:12.937 --> 24:13.657
Don't scare me.

24:13.657 --> 24:14.977
Do you know what you're saying?

24:15.056 --> 24:16.617
I absolutely know what I'm saying.

24:17.617 --> 24:18.536
I'm grateful to you.

24:18.857 --> 24:19.816
My Newbie Pack.

24:20.657 --> 24:23.576
Promise me
you'll be happy in this world.

24:24.016 --> 24:24.576
I'm leaving.

24:31.417 --> 24:32.457
What's wrong with her?

24:41.857 --> 24:43.576
Hello, I'm Lin Huan'er.

25:02.536 --> 25:04.377
(Smile, eye contact,)

25:04.776 --> 25:05.776
(raised eyebrows,)

25:05.776 --> 25:06.857
(and zygomatic muscles.)

25:07.296 --> 25:08.776
(Activated prefrontal cortex shows)

25:08.776 --> 25:10.657
(if he has feelings for me.)

25:11.897 --> 25:14.937
(Gao Haiming, your answer is)

25:15.776 --> 25:16.336
(yes.)

25:20.857 --> 25:21.776
You're stunning.

25:22.816 --> 25:23.377
Thank you.

25:23.776 --> 25:25.897
Your makeup is quite distinctive too.

25:26.217 --> 25:27.056
I made it.

25:31.496 --> 25:32.496
If you'll excuse me.

25:32.857 --> 25:33.417
Of course.

25:46.377 --> 25:46.984
Hello.

25:48.200 --> 25:48.937
Chairman.

25:49.336 --> 25:52.217
What were you talking about
at the party?

25:53.776 --> 25:54.657
I didn't say much.

25:55.217 --> 25:56.496
They were the ones being rude.

25:56.897 --> 25:58.977
They're elders, after all.

25:59.096 --> 26:01.657
What you did tonight
makes you seem flippant.

26:03.217 --> 26:04.697
I don't think their opinions matter.

26:04.897 --> 26:08.056
Harmony brings prosperity in business.
Understand?

26:08.736 --> 26:09.377
One more thing,

26:09.977 --> 26:13.096
don't try to weasel
out of tomorrow's blind date.

26:13.256 --> 26:15.937
Don't mess it up. Understood?

26:17.496 --> 26:20.496
Touch, hugs, and kisses,

26:21.137 --> 26:24.857
these all build trust and intimacy.

26:25.256 --> 26:27.256
(To make a strong first impression,)

26:27.496 --> 26:31.617
(the key step
is subtle physical contact.)

26:32.897 --> 26:34.417
(Physical contact?)

26:35.056 --> 26:37.177
(How to create opportunities
for physical contact?)

26:49.256 --> 26:50.096
It's you!

26:51.536 --> 26:52.536
We meet again.

26:53.288 --> 26:54.968
You're not from this world either,
are you?

26:55.336 --> 26:56.296
What's your quest?

26:57.697 --> 26:58.217
I'm sorry?

27:02.177 --> 27:03.016
No spoilers.

27:03.576 --> 27:04.296
Got it.

27:06.937 --> 27:09.217
You made a chance running into me again?

27:11.056 --> 27:13.657
Last time at the model shop,
you pretended to be confused.

27:13.657 --> 27:14.857
Now, you've followed me here.

27:17.816 --> 27:19.137
Do you truly not recognize me?

27:23.736 --> 27:24.336
Alright.

27:25.377 --> 27:26.536
Seems you're just an NPC.

27:26.816 --> 27:27.776
Let's cut to the chase.

27:28.496 --> 27:29.217
Do me a favor.

27:29.217 --> 27:30.496
(50 yuan)
It will be yours.

27:38.177 --> 27:39.096
So greedy.

27:39.857 --> 27:41.776
Fine. What about now?

27:41.776 --> 27:42.952
(100 yuan)

27:44.137 --> 27:45.536
Just follow my instructions,

27:45.736 --> 27:46.857
and the money will be yours.

27:48.977 --> 27:49.736
Easy money, right?

27:52.816 --> 27:53.617
Yes, Madam.

27:53.617 --> 27:55.096
At your service.

29:22.536 --> 29:23.056
Sorry.

29:23.177 --> 29:23.816
It's okay.

29:25.617 --> 29:26.336
What is this?

29:27.377 --> 29:29.177
Helping you up costs extra.

29:30.056 --> 29:31.496
I only asked you to tip over a tray.

29:31.496 --> 29:33.056
Why did you bring a whole cart?

29:33.056 --> 29:34.457
Are you purposely causing trouble?

29:35.016 --> 29:36.256
I went above and beyond.

29:36.617 --> 29:37.177
200 yuan more.

29:37.417 --> 29:38.217
Are you kidding?

29:38.657 --> 29:39.536
I'm trying to help.

29:40.377 --> 29:42.217
Are you?
Do you know what I'm trying to do?

29:43.296 --> 29:44.056
I can tell.

29:45.016 --> 29:47.177
Well, may you succeed.

29:50.377 --> 29:52.137
(What? What's wrong with this NPC?)

29:55.977 --> 29:56.617
Are you okay?

29:57.377 --> 29:57.937
I'm fine.

29:58.897 --> 30:01.296
I just felt a bit dizzy earlier.

30:02.617 --> 30:04.177
Let me help you over there to rest.

30:19.457 --> 30:21.897
Miss Lin,
you were startled just now, weren't you?

30:23.657 --> 30:24.177
No, I wasn't.

30:25.296 --> 30:26.096
Something to drink?

30:26.096 --> 30:26.897
I'll get it for you.

30:29.736 --> 30:30.816
Let me get it for you.

30:31.016 --> 30:32.072
What do you want to drink?

30:33.177 --> 30:34.217
(Just ignore it.)

30:35.056 --> 30:37.137
(This is inside a 90s romance novel.)

30:37.496 --> 30:38.296
(He's not a man.)

30:38.296 --> 30:39.857
(He's not even a person.)

30:40.096 --> 30:41.296
(He's just a fictional man.)

30:41.736 --> 30:43.977
(He's the key back to the real world.)

30:47.697 --> 30:48.296
I'm leaving.

30:57.256 --> 30:57.977
You're married?

30:59.617 --> 31:00.657
Aren't you single?

31:03.657 --> 31:06.657
Does that matter to us?

31:07.417 --> 31:08.657
Show some respect!

31:09.096 --> 31:11.177
Why did the system
assign someone like you?

31:12.296 --> 31:12.977
What system?

31:14.217 --> 31:14.977
Miss Lin.

31:15.657 --> 31:17.296
Don't think I don't know what you want.

31:18.496 --> 31:19.296
Stop pretending.

31:20.096 --> 31:21.576
You bad guy!

31:21.897 --> 31:24.096
You're married and still fooling around!

31:24.536 --> 31:26.336
Can't you have some respect
for your family?

31:27.336 --> 31:28.177
People are watching.

31:28.457 --> 31:29.177
Get out of here.

31:30.096 --> 31:31.056
Let go of me!

31:32.457 --> 31:33.096
Huan'er.

31:34.177 --> 31:34.816
Mr. Lu.

31:36.816 --> 31:37.576
Mr. Lu?

31:39.296 --> 31:40.336
Isn't your surname Gao?

31:41.217 --> 31:42.177
Why?

31:44.336 --> 31:45.576
Aren't you Gao Haiming?

31:45.576 --> 31:47.177
(I actually got the wrong person.)

31:48.937 --> 31:49.977
Huan'er, what's wrong?

31:49.977 --> 31:51.417
I've had enough of it!

31:51.657 --> 31:52.336
I need to vent!

31:52.336 --> 31:53.496
I know a place.

32:01.177 --> 32:02.536
Pretty exciting, right?

32:02.736 --> 32:03.816
This is way too exciting!

32:07.457 --> 32:08.576
A kick!

32:09.977 --> 32:11.457
You're dead.

32:11.776 --> 32:12.736
You're so powerful!

32:28.040 --> 32:29.977
(Nine Dragons)

32:29.977 --> 32:31.377
Yes, this is the one!

32:31.816 --> 32:32.536
I want this one.

32:32.857 --> 32:33.977
Got it!

32:35.377 --> 32:36.576
You're amazing!

32:36.576 --> 32:37.296
Thanks.

32:39.377 --> 32:41.056
I haven't relaxed like this in ages.

32:42.016 --> 32:43.177
You finally smiled.

32:44.256 --> 32:44.857
That's great.

32:45.496 --> 32:47.857
You haven't smiled much
since Xiaojue left for England.

32:49.177 --> 32:49.857
Is that so?

32:51.536 --> 32:54.457
Huan'er, I really envy you and Xiaojue.

32:55.137 --> 32:56.977
Though you're not physically together,

32:57.417 --> 33:00.096
you're still in each other's hearts.

33:03.296 --> 33:05.137
That's the kind of love I long for.

33:08.776 --> 33:11.697
Seems we don't share the same feelings.

33:14.336 --> 33:15.937
Huan'er, what troubles you?

33:17.016 --> 33:20.576
Oh, I have way too many troubles.

33:22.137 --> 33:22.617
Mengmeng.

33:24.096 --> 33:26.857
Didn't you say before
that you think I'm different now?

33:29.096 --> 33:30.697
So, do you like the current me better?

33:35.377 --> 33:37.096
But I often don't understand

33:37.096 --> 33:38.496
what you're talking about.

33:40.816 --> 33:41.417
Doesn't matter.

33:41.697 --> 33:42.736
The feeling matters.

33:43.417 --> 33:44.417
As long as you feel it.

33:44.937 --> 33:46.217
I just want to tell you

33:48.496 --> 33:50.776
to cherish Lin Huan'er right now,

33:51.256 --> 33:54.536
because she might not stay for long.

33:55.536 --> 33:58.496
See? I don't get it again.

33:59.657 --> 34:00.336
Doesn't matter.

34:01.776 --> 34:02.296
Eat.

34:16.417 --> 34:17.817
What a good cartoonist.

34:18.576 --> 34:19.337
Nice drawing.

34:20.536 --> 34:21.297
Have some milk.

34:21.817 --> 34:22.216
Thanks.

34:27.257 --> 34:27.696
Mengmeng.

34:28.297 --> 34:29.777
How have your parents been lately?

34:30.857 --> 34:32.377
Same as always.

34:32.377 --> 34:34.297
They're traveling the world.

34:35.696 --> 34:36.176
Wonderful.

34:36.777 --> 34:38.576
That's exactly the life
I've been dreaming of.

34:40.337 --> 34:42.176
You can't leave freely.

34:42.176 --> 34:44.297
You can't leave your dad
and Le'er alone.

34:46.616 --> 34:48.257
(According to the book,)

34:48.616 --> 34:51.176
(Lin Huan'er's dad is a kind man,)

34:51.777 --> 34:54.136
(and her sister is a strange kid)

34:54.496 --> 34:55.937
(detached from everyone else.)

34:56.857 --> 34:58.616
(She gets along well with Lin Huan'er.)

35:01.297 --> 35:03.496
(This should be Lin Le'er.)

35:05.457 --> 35:08.817
Mengmeng, when was this photo taken?

35:10.337 --> 35:11.176
You forgot this?

35:11.737 --> 35:14.257
It was taken
when we took Le'er back to our school.

35:20.696 --> 35:21.216
What's wrong?

35:24.257 --> 35:26.897
So annoying.
I have to go on a blind date tomorrow.

35:28.377 --> 35:29.536
Just don't go.

35:30.216 --> 35:31.257
Absolutely not possible.

35:31.257 --> 35:32.457
My family has arranged it.

35:32.457 --> 35:34.337
If I don't go,
they'll definitely lecture me.

35:35.176 --> 35:36.056
It's simple.

35:36.056 --> 35:37.417
Just go show your face

35:37.417 --> 35:38.737
and mess it up.

35:40.136 --> 35:40.937
Is that possible?

35:44.257 --> 35:45.496
How about you go instead of me?

35:46.312 --> 35:47.536
I don't have much experience.

35:47.777 --> 35:49.696
But if you go,
you could definitely mess it up.

35:50.297 --> 35:51.817
That's not appropriate.

35:52.457 --> 35:54.056
But one thing for sure is

35:54.897 --> 35:56.496
that I can mess up your blind date.

35:57.457 --> 35:59.536
So I'll go mess it up for you?

35:59.696 --> 36:00.337
Really?

36:00.897 --> 36:02.457
You're the best!

36:02.777 --> 36:03.536
Come on.

36:04.576 --> 36:05.297
Cheers.

36:19.616 --> 36:20.777
Sorry to keep you waiting.

36:26.216 --> 36:28.457
You're the extra money guy!

36:28.977 --> 36:30.056
Zhu Mengmeng?

36:33.552 --> 36:36.535
♪Entwined worries linger♪

36:37.744 --> 36:40.515
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

36:42.416 --> 36:48.329
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

36:50.126 --> 36:53.186
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

36:54.352 --> 36:57.804
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

36:58.800 --> 37:04.326
♪Until the world's end♪

37:06.736 --> 37:10.532
♪If I could♪

37:11.120 --> 37:13.936
♪Keep loving you♪

37:14.960 --> 37:17.360
♪Hearing two hearts♪

37:17.360 --> 37:22.276
♪Beating together♪

37:23.248 --> 37:27.112
♪If I could♪

37:27.112 --> 37:30.352
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

37:31.408 --> 37:38.733
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

37:39.792 --> 37:42.736
♪Entwined worries linger♪

37:43.984 --> 37:46.736
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

37:48.592 --> 37:54.372
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

37:56.304 --> 37:59.329
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

38:00.574 --> 38:04.240
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

38:05.008 --> 38:10.855
♪Until the world's end♪

38:12.848 --> 38:16.752
♪If I could♪

38:17.360 --> 38:20.112
♪Keep loving you♪

38:21.168 --> 38:23.504
♪Hearing two hearts♪

38:23.504 --> 38:28.464
♪Beating together♪

38:29.456 --> 38:33.019
♪If I could♪

38:33.019 --> 38:36.720
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

38:37.712 --> 38:44.944
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪
